WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.940
盐点港的海面之下，潮门背后，藏着一个海中王国。
Beneath Saltpoint Coast, behind the Tidal Gate, lies a kingdom of the sea.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:10.180
按最古老的律法，王子必须先娶新娘，才能加冕。
By its oldest law, the prince cannot be crowned until he takes a bride.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.960
议会已经替他选好了人。
The council has already chosen one for him.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.460
雷恩王子拒绝了。
Prince Rian has refused her.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.350
而潮门发光时，找到它的人类……会被留下，并忘记一切。
And when the gate glows, any human who finds it is kept... and made to forget.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.800
盐点港海岸 · 清晨 6:12
Saltpoint Coast · 6:12 AM

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.600
Skye，你看！海水在发光！
Skye, look! The water is glowing!

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.450
米拉！
Mila!

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.650
这是……哪里？
Where... am I?

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:52.200
潮门 · 藏在海下的王宫
The Tidal Gate · a palace beneath the sea

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:01.150
我朋友，穿黄外套的。她在哪？
My friend. Yellow jacket. Where is she?

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:07.700
她很安全。访客不得进入这一翼。未登记的访客会被扣留，
She is safe. Visitors cannot enter this wing. Unregistered visitors are held,

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.150
关于这里的记忆，也会被封存。
and their memory of this place is sealed.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:23.600
她跟我一起。
She is with me.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:27.500
我未来的新娘。
My future bride.

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:28.650
是真的吗？
Is that true?

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:36.920
她：你说清楚，你要我演新娘，是为了躲谁？
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 1 轮）

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:39.828
有话直说。我喜欢这样。
Straight to the point. I like that.

00:01:40.028 --> 00:01:42.837
赛拉。舰队的继承人。他们要我们成婚。
Sera. The fleet's heir. They want us married.

00:01:46.045 --> 00:01:48.854
我借你躲掉它。这是实话。
I used you to dodge it. That's the truth.

00:01:49.054 --> 00:01:51.862
回答得很勇敢，侄子。
Bold answer, nephew.

00:01:52.062 --> 00:01:54.870
白天说的谎，一样要算账。
A lie in daylight still counts.

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:57.879
那就罚我。放她过去。
Then charge me. Let her pass.

00:01:58.079 --> 00:02:00.887
去吧。你的朋友在会客厅等你。
Go. Your friend waits in the drawing room.

00:02:04.096 --> 00:02:06.904
先见米拉。其他的事之后再说。
Mila first. Everything else after.

00:02:07.204 --> 00:02:09.504
她：好，我陪你演三晚。先带我去你给我安排的房间
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 2 轮）

00:02:09.604 --> 00:02:14.418
她：好。三晚。现在带我去看房间。
Fine. Three nights. Now the room.

00:02:14.618 --> 00:02:19.432
我的新娘住王宫最好的房间。
My bride gets the best room in the palace.

00:02:19.632 --> 00:02:24.446
别爱上这里的装潢，忍着点。
Try not to fall in love with the decor.

00:02:26.795 --> 00:02:28.744

Yours. The pool leads straight to open sea.

00:02:33.241 --> 00:02:35.190
今晚王宫设宴。以新娘身份来，或不来，你定。
First gift. It's real, unlike the title.

00:02:37.539 --> 00:02:39.488

Tonight the palace hosts a feast. Come as my bride—or.

00:02:39.788 --> 00:02:42.088
她：我伸手摸你的耳鳍，你承认那光是为我亮的
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 3 轮）

00:02:42.188 --> 00:02:44.996
她：别动。别躲。
Hold still. Don't dodge.

00:02:45.196 --> 00:02:48.005
小心。它不会说谎。
Careful. It doesn't lie.

00:02:48.205 --> 00:02:51.013
是灯光。灯不好。
It's the lights. Bad ones.

00:02:54.222 --> 00:02:57.030
好。是你。每一次。
Fine. It's you. Every time.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:00.791
你要真话。现在给你了。
You wanted the truth. Now you have it.

00:03:00.991 --> 00:03:04.551
每次你看我，它都亮。对。
Every time you look at me. Yes.

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:08.312
现在轮到你了。
Now it's your turn.

00:03:12.372 --> 00:03:14.672
她：带我下水吧，我想看你变回人鱼的样子
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 4 轮）

00:03:14.772 --> 00:03:18.333
你还欠我一寸。
You still owe me an inch.

00:03:18.533 --> 00:03:22.093
呼吸。
First rule of the sea: breathe.

00:03:26.054 --> 00:03:29.614
下去以后把眼睛睁好。
Keep your eyes open down there.

00:03:32.321 --> 00:03:34.628
还不错吧？
Not bad, right?

00:03:34.828 --> 00:03:37.135
你在盯着我看。
You're staring.

00:03:39.842 --> 00:03:42.149
你的世界没有那么远。
Your world is not that far.

00:03:42.349 --> 00:03:44.656
盐点港。你的海港。想近点看看吗？
Salt Point. Your harbor. Want a closer look?

00:03:44.956 --> 00:03:47.256
她：回岸上吧，你把宫廷装穿回去，我们去见维萨
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 5 轮）

00:03:47.356 --> 00:03:50.164
这就舍下我的海了？
Leaving my ocean already?

00:03:50.364 --> 00:03:53.173
比谁先到家，新娘。
Race you home, bride.

00:03:53.373 --> 00:03:56.181
先找维萨。胆子不小。
Vessa first. Bold choice.

00:03:56.381 --> 00:03:59.190
十秒就干。新纪录。
Dry in ten seconds. New record.

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:02.198
王子不能湿着出场。
Princes don't do wet entrances.

00:04:06.159 --> 00:04:09.719
晚宴前就回来了。没想到。
Back before the feast. Unexpected.

00:04:09.919 --> 00:04:13.480
你朋友今晚可以走。
Your friend may leave tonight.

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:17.240
登记册要先写她的真名。
The registry needs her true name first.
